@crew park-noor
// Writer (command), batch 2: everyday lines (greet, feel, near, life, joy) from the card and the roster.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Hi. Park, night Watch. I'll show you the patrol route if you're ever up late.
? tier>=acquaintance
- Hi, {me}. Picked up an extra shift. That's another plank of the boat.
- Hello, {me}. Locker tidy? Mine is. I've labelled the labels.   #funny
? tier>=friend
- Oh, hi, {me}. I'm glad you came by. It's been a long week.   #warm
== feel
? mood:high
- Good patrol. Quiet decks. I worked out the boat's sail, in my head.
? mood:low
- Tired. Two shifts back to back. The boat had better be worth it.
== near
? act:leisure
- I'm learning the guitar, badly. There's a waiting list for the book.   #funny
? habit:stargazer
- I pick out the stars over Coriel. You can't see them from here. I pretend.
== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I'm saving for a boat on Coriel. A small one. Blue, I think.
== joy
? tier>=colleague
- The boat. Water slapping the side, nothing to fix, nowhere to be. One day.

// ---- Writer 2, batch 2: to ~30 (greet by time and warmth, near, invite, accept, decline, missed, birthday, cue, hint, about)
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning
- Morning, {me}. Shift's done. Locker's tidy. Bed next. In that order.
? tier>=acquaintance warmth:cold
- Oh, hello, {me}. It's been a while. I hope you've been resting. Properly.

== near
? habit:shopper
- I only look in the crew store. I don't buy. Every credit's a plank.
? place:musicroom
- Guitar practice. Lindqvist has the book till nine. Then it's mine. I wrote it down.

== invite
- Friday jam? I'll play one song. Badly. Come and clap anyway.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance
- Observatory night? I've worked out where Coriel is. Roughly. Come and see.

== accept
- Yes. I'll come. I'll be on time. I always am.
- Thank you. Yes. I'd like that.

== decline
- I can't. Extra shift. The boat, you know. Another night?
? weekday:wed|thu
- Rest day. I'm actually resting. Oduya made me promise. Friday?

== missed
- You didn't come. That's all right. I practised guitar. My bunk wasn't so lucky.   #funny

== birthday
? birthday:you
- Happy birthday, {me}. I'll play you a song. Or I won't. Your choice. Choose won't.   #funny
? birthday:me
- My birthday. I bought one thing. A little brass hook for the boat. Don't laugh.

== cue
? cue:event.ionStorm.onset
- Storm's in. I'll be on patrol. You stay in your bunk. Please.

== hint
- {me}, have you a minute later? There's something I'd like to tell you.

== about
? aff:rahman-farah:friend
- Rahman's saving for a boat too. Hesper Dock. We trade sums. It helps, somehow.   #warm

// ---- Writer 2, batch 2: top-up (bye, greet by time, life at friend tier)
== bye
- Bye, {me}. Mind your locker. Labels face out.
- Goodnight. I mean, good day. I'm on nights. It's confusing.   #funny
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:evening
- Evening, {me}. Night shift soon. Patrol route's printed. And labelled.
== life
? tier>=friend
- The boat's name is a secret. Even from me. I'll know it when I see the water.
